<title>USA: Sport Supply says Kennedy Capital ups stake.</title>
<headline>Sport Supply says Kennedy Capital ups stake.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sport Supply Group Inc said on Wednesday Kennedy Capital Management Inc increased its holdings of the company's stock to 559,200 shares, or 6.7 percent of the outstanding stock.</p>
<p>The company said a Schedule 13G was filed on February 10.</p>
<p>Sports Supply is a factory direct distributor of sports equipment to the institutional market.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
